{"unit_id":"nishit130__dsh-notification#card-zh","repo":"nishit130/dsh-notification","commit":"c53b9ff4b4901a241745d1745fd8af0e5e4b1ffd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notification 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的事件提醒插件。它在服务器端监听 Agent 状态、错误和审批请求，并在浏览器端观察会话列表；主要功能包括 Agent 完成时提醒、运行错误提醒、工具等待审批时提醒，以及按运行时长筛除过快完成的任务。通知可显示为服务器主机的桌面弹窗、浏览器通知，或发送为含 Slack 兼容 text 字段的 JSON Webhook。适合希望离开页面后仍及时知道任务进度的 DSH 用户。桌面通知使用系统原生通知能力，浏览器通知需要用户授予权限；Webhook 地址为可选配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:73-119","client.js:48-69","client.js:92-128"]}
{"unit_id":"nishit130__dsh-notification#card-en","repo":"nishit130/dsh-notification","commit":"c53b9ff4b4901a241745d1745fd8af0e5e4b1ffd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notification alerts DSH users when agents finish, fail, or await approval. Server listeners and a browser session watcher can show desktop or browser notifications, or send JSON webhooks. A duration threshold suppresses quick-turn alerts; browser popups require permission.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:73-119","client.js:48-69","client.js:92-128"]}
