{"unit_id":"nishit130__dsh-notification#feature-1","repo":"nishit130/dsh-notification","commit":"c53b9ff4b4901a241745d1745fd8af0e5e4b1ffd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notification 的功能「完成提醒」：检测 Agent 从 running 变为 idle，运行达到时长阈值后发送桌面、Webhook 或浏览器提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:89-101","client.js:113-118"]}
{"unit_id":"nishit130__dsh-notification#feature-2","repo":"nishit130/dsh-notification","commit":"c53b9ff4b4901a241745d1745fd8af0e5e4b1ffd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notification 的功能「运行错误提醒」：监听 agent/error 事件，整理错误内容并附上 turn 和 step 信息。启用桌面或 Webhook 通道后，错误会以 error 级别发出。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:103-108"]}
{"unit_id":"nishit130__dsh-notification#feature-3","repo":"nishit130/dsh-notification","commit":"c53b9ff4b4901a241745d1745fd8af0e5e4b1ffd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notification 的功能「审批提醒」：观察审批请求并提示工具名称和原因，随后调用 next() 交给后续处理器；浏览器也提示待处理交互。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:110-119","client.js:109-112"]}
{"unit_id":"nishit130__dsh-notification#feature-4","repo":"nishit130/dsh-notification","commit":"c53b9ff4b4901a241745d1745fd8af0e5e4b1ffd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notification 的功能「多渠道通知」：可用桌面弹窗、浏览器通知或 Webhook；Webhook 接收含摘要、正文和时间戳的 JSON POST。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:77-86","index.js:43-62","client.js:60-69"]}
